    "Secure Keyboard Entry is active. macOS may block global shortcuts; click this menu bar icon to open Pastera." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安全键盘输入已启用。macOS 可能会阻止全局快捷键；点击这个菜单栏图标可打开 Pastera。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secure Keyboard Entry is active in a password prompt. Finish or cancel it, then Pastera shortcuts will work again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "密码提示正在使用安全键盘输入。完成或取消后，Pastera 快捷键会恢复。"
